Package: com.mak.amnezia6
Name: Amnezia6
Version: 1.3.3
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Lightweight AmneziaWG client for iOS 4-7
 A small native AmneziaWG client: a root daemon owns the UTUN device,
 routing, DNS and the WireGuard/AmneziaWG 3.1 protocol, and a UIKit app
 controls it over a Unix socket.
 .
 Supports header protection, junk packets, I1-I5 signatures, S1-S4 and
 H1-H4. Requires a jailbroken device with root access.
Depends: firmware (>= 4.3), firmware (<< 8.0), mobilesubstrate
Section: Networking
Priority: optional
Maintainer: mak
Author: mak
Icon: file:///Applications/Amnezia6.app/Icon-72.png
